ES:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Esta planta está recién inaugurada!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No lo habríamos logrado sin la
ayuda de todos.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}C'est grâce à toi{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} que nous avons
pu inaugurer ce nouvel étage !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merci infiniment !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Senin sayende{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} bu kat yeni
açıldı!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tüm desteğin için çok teşekkür ederiz!

EN:
We're currently holding a number of
displays on this floor, including the
{{TAG:0012:0007:00CD}} exhibit.
Also, the {{TAG:0012:0007:01CD}}
and the {{TAG:0012:0007:02CD}}
exhibits are set up for viewing!

TRANSLATION:
Bu katta şu anda birkaç sergi
var; bunlardan biri {{TAG:0012:0007:00CD}}.
Ayrıca {{TAG:0012:0007:01CD}}
ve {{TAG:0012:0007:02CD}}
sergilerini de gezebilirsin!

{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kişisel sergi alanları
hakkında söyleyeceklerim bu
kadar!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Ayrıca{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} koridorda hediyelik eşya
da satıyorum, sık sık uğra.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Alt kattaki koleksiyonlar
büyüdükçe hatıra ürünleri de getiriyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Onları da kaçırma!

Sergi alanını kiraladıktan sonra{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
kendi odan gibi istediğin
şekilde düzenleyebilirsin!
Merdiven yanındaki dolabı
kullanırsan{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}evindeki eşyalara kolayca ulaşırsın.
Sergi odasına eşya çıkarmak ya
da geri koymak böyle çok kolay
olur.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Gerçekten kullanışlı!

Ayrıca,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} kişisel sergi odasının
önündeki tabelaya bakarsan...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
poster için kendi tasarımını
seçebilir ya da sergiye bir ad
verebilirsin.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Odanın reklamı gibi düşün!

EN:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} are you sure?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, please look around
as much as you'd like!

TRANSLATION:
Eyvah,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} şu anda yeterli Bell'in
yok gibi görünüyor{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yeterince biriktirince yine gel!

Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ceplerin dolu olduğu için
eşyayı şu anda veremem{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Biraz yer açınca tekrar gel!

DE:
Der Preis dafür beträgt
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:000C:0000}} Sternis{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ist das in Ordnung für dich?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Abgemacht!
Lieber doch nicht...

EN:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}, you are currently using
multiple personal exhibit rooms.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Which one would you like to close?{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}, in questo momento
stai utilizzando diverse sale.
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Quale mostra vuoi interrompere?{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}, şu anda birden fazla
kişisel sergi odası
kullanıyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hangisini kapatmak istersin?{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}

DE:
Also gut.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dann weiterhin viel Spaß mit
deiner Ausstellung!

EN:
When you close your exhibit room,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
all of the items in it will be moved
to the locker.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Is that OK?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
No problem!
I changed my mind.

FR:
Si tu fermes une salle d'exposition,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
tous les objets qui s'y trouvent sont
transférés dans le casier.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ça te va ?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Pas de problème !
J'ai changé d'avis.

TRANSLATION:
Sergi odanı kapattığında{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
içindeki tüm eşyalar dolaba taşınacak.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Buna razı mısın?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Sorun değil!
Vazgeçtim.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}All exhibit spaces are being used.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Please come back again {{TAG:0003:0001:}}when we
have a room available.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Le sale sono tutte occupate.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Torna quando {{TAG:0003:0001:}}avremo
una sala disponibile!

DE:
Die Miete für den Ausstellungsraum
beträgt {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}10.000 Sternis{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ist das in Ordnung?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Klar!
Eher nicht...

EN:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} are you positively sure?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
All right.{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Please feel free to talk to
me when you'd like to use a room!

ES:
Uhuuu,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¿has cambiado de parecer?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Bueno, si necesitas cualquier cosa,
házmelo saber.

FR:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} tu es vraiment {{TAG:000E:0006:06007300FB00720008007300FB0072006500}} ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Très bien. {{TAG:0003:0001:}}N'hésite pas à venir me
voir si tu veux louer une salle !

IT:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sei sicur{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Va bene.{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Se decidi di prendere in
affitto una sala, vieni pure da me!

TRANSLATION:
Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} gerçekten emin misin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Pekâlâ.{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Bir oda kullanmak
istediğinde benimle konuşabilirsin!

DE:
Die Miete für einen Ausstellungs-
raum beträgt {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}10.000 Sternis{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ist das in Ordnung?{{TAG:000D:0008:02CD}}{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Klar!
Eher nicht...

TRANSLATION:
Tamam.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Kira peşin ödeniyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}yeterli Bell'in olduğunda
yeniden gel.

FR:
Tu peux agencer et décorer les
salles d'exposition à ta guise,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
comme tu le ferais dans ta maison !
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}De plus,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} tu peux coller une affiche{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
et donner un titre à ton exposition
sur la pancarte devant la salle.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sanırım hepsi bu.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ne yapıp yapamayacağını
unutursan istediğin zaman tekrar sorabilirsin!
